      "sourceText": "PSY 103 - Introduction to Psychology 3 credits; One of the following statistics courses: PSY 201; AMS 102; AMS 110; AMS 310; BUS 215; ECO 320; POL 201; SOC 202; Another statistics course approved by the department; PSY 310 - Research and Writing in Psychology 4 credits"
    },
    {
      "id": "psychology-ba.survey-courses",
      "label": "survey-courses",
      "title": "Survey Courses in Psychology",
      "rule": {
        "type": "choose",
        "count": 3,
        "from": {
          "courses": [
            "PSY 220",
            "PSY 230",
            "PSY 240",
            "PSY 250",
            "PSY 260"
