      "sourceText": "For the B.A. student: One course numbered 200 or higher, excluding PSY 201, PSY 273, PSY 283, PSY 310, PSY 399, PSY 447, PSY 475, PSY 476, PSY 487, PSY 488, PSY 495-PSY 496, the discontinued PSY 300, and 200-level survey courses used to satisfy requirement #2. Four more courses from among advanced courses numbered PSY 301 to PSY 383, excluding PSY 310."
